      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Having any kind of player collision would be amazing and add a whole new aspect to vrchat. The main reason it would add more to do, and thats the main reason ive had  many friends stop playing vrchat. Yes there is gaming worlds and maps for PVP but having the ability to interact with each other adds so much potential. U can literally be a bad guy and rp the hell out of it. There should be at least an option to turn it on for certain worlds or maybe even a PVP toggle locally just like everything else.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
